   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Notebook 5 — DinoTXT Zero-Shot Verb Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook performs zero-shot verb prediction on YouCook2 using the\n",
    "precomputed DinoTXT video embeddings from NB4.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Approach:**\n",
    "- Load precomputed video embedding for each segment (`{segment_id}.pt`)\n",
    "- For each segment, fill the `[MASK]` slot in the masked caption with\n",
    "  every verb in the vocabulary to produce candidate text descriptions\n",
    "- Encode all candidates with the frozen DinoTXT text tower\n",
    "- Pick the verb whose text embedding is most similar to the video embedding\n",
    "- No training — purely zero-shot similarity in the shared vision-language space\n",
    "\n",
    "**Reads:**\n",
    "- `annotations/segments_verbs_timed.csv` — captions, verbs, segment IDs\n",
    "- `embeddings/dinov2/{segment_id}.pt` — precomputed video embeddings from NB4\n",
    "\n",
    "**Produces:**\n",
    "- Top-1 and Top-5 verb prediction accuracy on the validation set"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Load data"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
