      "  DinoTXT Zero-Shot — Preliminary Results\n",
      "==================================================\n",
      "  Segments evaluated : 566\n",
      "  Top-1 Accuracy     : 3.00%\n",
      "  Top-5 Accuracy     : 13.07%\n",
      "==================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "Breakdown by split:\n",
      "  training      Top-1: 2.78%   Top-5: 12.96%   (n=432)\n",
      "  validation    Top-1: 3.73%   Top-5: 13.43%   (n=134)\n",
      "\n",
      "  Majority-class baseline (always predict 'add'): 30.04%\n",
      "\n",
